  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leadership and engagement of Adolescents and Youth in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YCAC-MOZ is a coalition of 40 national Civil Society Organizations and individuals, which works to strengthen climate activism, through the promotion, youth participation, inclusion and fostering initiatives of transformative movements that involve children and young people as agents of change in society. The Agreement aims to improve the participation of young people in climate change agendas at national, regional, and international levels as well as strengthen the technical capacity of the YCAC. 
AEFUM - is am association member of the YCAC.</narrative>
  </description>
